  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Parfymia — Women's Fashion, Clothing &amp; Accessories </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Parfymia is your destination for premium fashion, accessories, watches, fragrances, and lifestyle products. Discover a wide selection of trending styles for women, men, and kids — with fast worldwide shipping and easy returns.</p><p class=\"pa__eyebrow\" style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgb(85,85,85);margin:0px 0px 8px;font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">Our Story</p><h2 class=\"pa__heading\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;font-size:32px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:normal;text-transform:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);margin:0px 0px 36px;text-indent:0px;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">Where Style Meets Accessibility</h2><div class=\"pa__story-body\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.78;color:rgb(85,85,85);margin:0px 0px 16px;\">Parfymia is an online fashion boutique founded in 2024, offering women's clothing, accessories, and lifestyle products curated for everyday style. We believe great fashion should be accessible, affordable, and delivered straight to your door.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.78;color:rgb(85,85,85);margin:0px;\">Our collections include women's tops, bottoms, dresses, bags, accessories, and pet fashion. Every product is handpicked for quality, fit, and style — so you can look and feel your best without the effort.</p></div></div></div>",
